<title>USA: TriNet seeks public offer of six mln shares.</title>
<headline>TriNet seeks public offer of six mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>TriNet Corporate Realty Trust Inc said it would make a proposed public offering of six milion shares of its common stock, none of which will be sold by shareholders.</p>
<p>On Tuesday the company reported fourth quarter profits of $0.64 a share, compared to a loss of $0.27 in the year-ago quarter.</p>
<p>The company reported having 13.9 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>It said underwriters would be granted an over-allotment option for 900,000 shares.</p>
<p>Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp is the lead managing underwriter.</p>
